1
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:10,200
Dear family,

2
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:12,320
Regarding Ling's Media's decision to change entertainment live streaming

3
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:14,540
into a beauty group stream,

4
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:15,800
I have a few thoughts.

5
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:16,860
First, I don't think

6
00:00:16,860 --> 00:00:18,060
this is a good change.

7
00:00:18,460 --> 00:00:19,060
Second,

8
00:00:19,780 --> 00:00:21,560
I firmly believe there must be

9
00:00:21,560 --> 00:00:23,500
some unknown bullying involved.

10
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:25,460
Just think about it, everyone.

11
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:28,200
Mucheng, an influencer with millions of fans,

12
00:00:28,860 --> 00:00:30,300
after stopping her streams for weeks,

13
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:32,740
suddenly returns and starts group streaming.

14
00:00:32,740 --> 00:00:34,000
Group streaming, family!

15
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:35,400
There must be

16
00:00:35,740 --> 00:00:37,740
capital manipulating behind the scenes.

17
00:00:37,740 --> 00:00:39,540
So I think they intend to squeeze

18
00:00:39,780 --> 00:00:41,260
all of Mucheng's value,

19
00:00:42,340 --> 00:00:44,700
and then ruthlessly abandon her.

20
00:01:35,800 --> 00:01:36,940
Stop asking.

21
00:02:12,040 --> 00:02:13,160
Where did he go?

22
00:02:15,780 --> 00:02:16,510
Look at this.

23
00:02:22,880 --> 00:02:24,540
Someone came looking for him.

24
00:02:25,440 --> 00:02:27,570
Could something have happened to him?

25
00:02:27,800 --> 00:02:29,130
It doesn't look like it.

26
00:02:30,600 --> 00:02:33,060
The person who came must be someone he knows.

27
00:02:34,780 --> 00:02:36,040
Who could it be?

28
00:02:48,140 --> 00:02:48,870
Attorney Gu.

29
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:50,480
There's a private art exhibition tonight.

30
00:02:50,480 --> 00:02:52,740
My father and his high-ranking friends will all attend.

31
00:02:52,740 --> 00:02:53,600
Are you coming?

32
00:02:53,940 --> 00:02:54,540
Of course.

33
00:02:54,940 --> 00:02:57,000
Okay, I'll send you the location now.

34
00:02:57,900 --> 00:02:58,480
Okay.

35
00:03:01,640 --> 00:03:04,500
It seems things are developing just like last time.

36
00:03:04,980 --> 00:03:05,780
Let's go.

37
00:03:08,740 --> 00:03:11,200
This may look like a private art exhibition,

38
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:14,600
but it's actually a private banquet for the elite.

39
00:03:14,680 --> 00:03:17,280
It's also my father's most important network.

40
00:03:19,440 --> 00:03:20,579
The guest list

41
00:03:20,579 --> 00:03:21,579
and their profiles

42
00:03:21,579 --> 00:03:23,640
I've already sent them to your phone.

43
00:03:27,120 --> 00:03:29,079
Mr. Lin, you really thought of everything.

44
00:03:29,079 --> 00:03:31,010
This also shows my determination,

45
00:03:31,480 --> 00:03:32,280
doesn't it?

46
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:37,600
Once the live stream starts,

47
00:03:37,940 --> 00:03:39,200
some of the people here

48
00:03:39,640 --> 00:03:42,170
will choose their favorite streamers to tip.

49
00:03:43,180 --> 00:03:44,579
After the live stream ends,

50
00:03:44,579 --> 00:03:45,500
they might

51
00:03:45,500 --> 00:03:47,630
ask me to send these streamers to them.

52
00:03:52,440 --> 00:03:53,960
That is my father.

53
00:03:55,280 --> 00:03:56,400
Welcome, Mr. Zhao.

54
00:03:56,860 --> 00:03:57,600
Okay.

55
00:03:59,040 --> 00:04:00,500
I'll go deal with it first.

56
00:04:00,780 --> 00:04:03,140
I'll let you know if anything happens.

57
00:04:07,640 --> 00:04:08,300
Uncle Zhao.

58
00:04:08,520 --> 00:04:09,180
Father.

59
00:04:10,540 --> 00:04:11,540
What do you think?

60
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:17,730
Don't you think he's being too proactive?

61
00:04:19,279 --> 00:04:20,680
Let's observe a bit more.

62
00:04:20,779 --> 00:04:21,820
Anyway, after tonight,

63
00:04:21,820 --> 00:04:23,620
we'll know if he's trustworthy.

64
00:04:30,680 --> 00:04:31,680
Why are you here?

65
00:04:33,200 --> 00:04:34,400
Something happened.

66
00:04:34,540 --> 00:04:35,500
Just now, a tycoon

67
00:04:35,500 --> 00:04:37,430
asked me to send Xiaoya to his room.

68
00:04:37,640 --> 00:04:38,580
Get ready.

69
00:04:38,640 --> 00:04:41,440
Call the police immediately if anything happens.

70
00:04:42,980 --> 00:04:43,800
Okay.

71
00:04:44,600 --> 00:04:46,800
Doesn't that mean you and your father

72
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:48,530
are openly against each other?

73
00:04:49,940 --> 00:04:51,640
Before I made this decision,

74
00:04:52,240 --> 00:04:54,100
I already knew this would happen.

75
00:04:55,040 --> 00:04:56,580
Now I can only trust you.

76
00:04:57,000 --> 00:04:59,580
Please make sure to keep me safe.

77
00:05:00,480 --> 00:05:02,540
Could your father actually harm you?

78
00:05:03,800 --> 00:05:05,200
You don't know my father.

79
00:05:05,440 --> 00:05:06,860
He is a ruthless man.

80
00:05:07,480 --> 00:05:08,680
The man next to my father just now

81
00:05:08,680 --> 00:05:09,740
is his adopted son.

82
00:05:09,980 --> 00:05:11,140
All the illegal and criminal acts

83
00:05:11,140 --> 00:05:12,380
are done by his adopted son.

84
00:05:12,380 --> 00:05:13,040
Lawyer Gu,

85
00:05:14,600 --> 00:05:15,660
Lawyer Gu's father

86
00:05:16,400 --> 00:05:17,640
was killed by him.

87
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:22,800
Don't worry.

88
00:05:23,880 --> 00:05:25,740
We will definitely keep you safe.

89
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:27,200
We won't let that happen.

90
00:05:28,340 --> 00:05:28,820
Okay.

91
00:05:29,260 --> 00:05:30,000
Thank you.

92
00:05:50,440 --> 00:05:51,240
Don't worry.

93
00:06:19,640 --> 00:06:20,780
Police! Freeze!

94
00:06:28,500 --> 00:06:30,180
What are you doing?

95
00:06:30,880 --> 00:06:32,280
Do you know who I am?

96
00:06:34,480 --> 00:06:35,280
Move.

97
00:06:37,940 --> 00:06:40,070
Stop all cooperation with Uncle Zhao.

98
00:06:40,280 --> 00:06:41,240
Do it cleanly.

99
00:06:42,800 --> 00:06:45,340
Have someone detain his family immediately.

100
00:07:00,880 --> 00:07:02,140
Someone is coming out.

101
00:07:03,640 --> 00:07:04,640
Should we follow?

102
00:07:09,480 --> 00:07:10,280
No.

103
00:07:10,640 --> 00:07:12,900
Let's just keep an eye on Ling Hengsheng.

104
00:07:13,640 --> 00:07:14,320
Relax.

105
00:07:14,420 --> 00:07:16,150
With me here, he won't get away.

106
00:07:23,280 --> 00:07:25,600
Finally, just one step away

107
00:07:25,980 --> 00:07:28,780
from clearing your father's name.

108
00:07:34,240 --> 00:07:34,770
Old Chen,

109
00:07:35,300 --> 00:07:36,040
thank you.

110
00:07:38,600 --> 00:07:39,730
What did you call me?

111
00:07:39,940 --> 00:07:40,800
Old Chen.

112
00:07:41,280 --> 00:07:43,010
Aren't you friends with my dad?

113
00:07:46,040 --> 00:07:47,040
You don't like it?

114
00:07:47,580 --> 00:07:48,220
Then,

115
00:07:48,540 --> 00:07:49,020
Old Yao?

116
00:07:49,800 --> 00:07:50,580
Uncle Chen?

117
00:07:51,520 --> 00:07:52,400
I like it.

118
00:07:53,440 --> 00:07:54,370
Old Chen is fine.

119
00:07:58,740 --> 00:08:00,600
It seems that since you appeared,

120
00:08:01,540 --> 00:08:02,880
all my unhappiness

121
00:08:03,640 --> 00:08:05,460
has been transferred to you.

122
00:08:08,080 --> 00:08:08,980
Thank you.

123
00:08:10,640 --> 00:08:13,780
Thank you for not minding how selfish I am.

124
00:08:18,380 --> 00:08:19,180
Xingcan,

125
00:08:21,380 --> 00:08:22,800
I don't feel wronged,

126
00:08:23,180 --> 00:08:24,140
and I don't mind.

127
00:08:25,840 --> 00:08:27,170
No matter what happens,

128
00:08:27,780 --> 00:08:29,510
I will always be your fallback.

129
00:08:58,820 --> 00:09:00,040
The killer.

130
00:09:06,840 --> 00:09:08,020
Chen Yao.

131
00:09:24,180 --> 00:09:25,110
Where did you go?

132
00:09:25,380 --> 00:09:26,240
Are you hungry?

133
00:09:31,440 --> 00:09:32,780
Did you not sleep well?

134
00:09:33,440 --> 00:09:34,880
Why don't you go home and rest?

135
00:09:34,880 --> 00:09:36,610
I'll keep an eye on things here.

136
00:09:37,140 --> 00:09:37,940
I'm fine.

137
00:09:40,200 --> 00:09:41,600
Maybe it's just that when I sleep lately,

138
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:43,340
I keep having weird dreams.

139
00:09:47,140 --> 00:09:48,420
I always dream about

140
00:09:49,280 --> 00:09:50,810
things from ancient times.

141
00:09:53,740 --> 00:09:54,540
What else?

142
00:09:58,440 --> 00:10:02,200
It seems like there are many familiar people around me.

143
00:10:03,480 --> 00:10:05,180
But I don't know who they are.

144
00:10:05,540 --> 00:10:06,580
I can't really explain it.

145
00:10:06,580 --> 00:10:08,440
I probably just didn't rest well.

146
00:10:10,940 --> 00:10:12,480
Xingcan.

147
00:10:13,540 --> 00:10:15,600
Then did you dream about...

148
00:10:23,240 --> 00:10:24,480
What did you say?

149
00:10:29,580 --> 00:10:30,380
What's wrong?

150
00:10:37,740 --> 00:10:38,670
Please sit down.

151
00:10:46,040 --> 00:10:46,660
I'm sorry.

152
00:10:47,440 --> 00:10:48,400
Our plan failed.

153
00:10:49,580 --> 00:10:50,980
According to the police investigation,

154
00:10:50,980 --> 00:10:52,180
Uncle Zhao and Xiaoya

155
00:10:52,500 --> 00:10:53,600
were both willing.

156
00:10:54,880 --> 00:10:57,210
Ling Hengsheng was not implicated at all.

157
00:10:59,840 --> 00:11:01,100
How could this happen?

158
00:11:02,000 --> 00:11:03,740
A powerful man like Uncle Zhao

159
00:11:04,200 --> 00:11:06,200
would actually protect Ling Hengsheng

160
00:11:06,200 --> 00:11:07,980
at the cost of his own reputation.

161
00:11:07,980 --> 00:11:08,840
Ling Hengsheng

162
00:11:09,320 --> 00:11:11,140
sent someone to kidnap Uncle Zhao's wife and daughter

163
00:11:11,140 --> 00:11:12,140
to blackmail him.

164
00:11:13,800 --> 00:11:15,060
I really didn't expect

165
00:11:15,280 --> 00:11:16,880
his methods to be so vicious.

166
00:11:17,440 --> 00:11:21,040
No wonder Young Master Long hurried away with his men last night.

167
00:11:21,040 --> 00:11:22,340
If I had followed them,

168
00:11:22,540 --> 00:11:24,680
this wouldn't have happened.

169
00:11:28,780 --> 00:11:31,580
How about we try again?
